message: >-
  If you use MRax in your research, please cite the specific release you used.
  Select that release on Zenodo at https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21723327
  and use its version-specific DOI. The metadata below describes MRax as a project.
title: "MRax: JAX-based tools for quantitative MRI research"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21723327
type: software
license: MIT
authors:
